nk</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Bridging the divide: global lessons from evidence-based health policy in Mexico.</article-title><source>Lancet</source><volume>368</volume><fpage>954</fpage><lpage>961</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16962886</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pmed.1000124-Frenk3"><label>25</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Frenk</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gonz&#x000e1;lez-Pier</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>G&#x000f3;mez-Dant&#x000e9;s</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Lezana</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Knaul</surname><given-names>FM</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Health system reform in Mexico 1: comprehensive reform to improve health system performance in Mexico.</article-title><source>Lancet</source><volume>368</volume><fpage>1524</fpage><lpage>1534</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17071286</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pmed.1000124-Gakidou1"><label>26</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gakidou</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Lozano</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Gonz&#x000e1;lez-Pier</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Abbott-Klafter</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Barofsky</surname><given-names>JT</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Health system reform in Mexico 5: assessing the effect of the 2001&#x02013;06 Mexican health reform: an interim report card.</article-title><source>Lancet</source><volume>368</volume><fpage>1920</fpage><lpage>1935</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17126725</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pmed.1000124